body:
Including a mixin that uses a `@content` block _without_ a block (`{ }`) after the mixin name causes an error:

```
TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'type')
```

Example:

```css
@mixin test {
  display: block;
  @content;
}

@include test {
  width: 20px;
}
/* PASS:
display: block;
width: 20px;
*/

@include test { }
/* PASS:
display: block;
*/

@include test;
/* ERROR with: TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'type') */
```

